              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nsubu wa kusambakena wa Yehowa wakasabo kudi Mose mu tshihela ne tshioshelu tshiandi biakadi ku mutu kua mukuna wa Gibeona mu tshikondo atshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
